BRANCHNE k_dah1g_i
ISUB DR3, DR3, #1
BRANCHNE k_dah1g_m
ISUB DR4, DR4, #1
BRANCHNE k_dah1g_o
ISUB DR5, DR5, #1
BRANCHNE k_dah1g_s

k_dit1:
